  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Cow?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/84/Cow.png/revision/latest?cb=20191025194659\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Cow\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cow\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Cow</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 6 • 15 • 27</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 50 • 600 • 1,150</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gives </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Milk</span><span title=\"Milk\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/milk-2141\" title=\"Milk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Milk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/92/Milk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20191025193427\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  every 1 h</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Cows</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/farm-15139\" title=\"Farm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">farm</a> <a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animals</a> that produce <a href=\"/wiki/milk-2141\" title=\"Milk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">milk</a>. They are unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 6. They are the second type of farm animal unlocked in the game.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/media/File%3ACow.png\" title=\"Cow.png (241 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/84/Cow.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025194659\" title=\"Cow.png (241 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Cow\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cow.png (241 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Cow\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Cow</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ACow_Walking.png\" title=\"Cow Walking.png (248 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Cow_Walking.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025194840\" title=\"Cow Walking.png (248 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Cow Walking\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cow Walking.png (248 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Cow Walking\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Cow Walking</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ACow_Mooing.png\" title=\"Cow Mooing.png (236 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/ae/Cow_Mooing.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025194840\" title=\"Cow Mooing.png (236 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Cow Mooing\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cow Mooing.png (236 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Cow Mooing\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Cow Mooing</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ACow_Tongue.png\" title=\"Cow Tongue.png (231 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/3a/Cow_Tongue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025194841\" title=\"Cow Tongue.png (231 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Cow Tongue\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cow Tongue.png (231 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Cow Tongue\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Cow Tongue</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ACow_Full.png\" title=\"Cow Full.png (223 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/1a/Cow_Full.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025194710\" title=\"Cow Full.png (223 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Cow Full\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cow Full.png (223 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Cow Full\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Cow Full</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ACow_Hungry.png\" title=\"Cow Hungry.png (214 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/40/Cow_Hungry.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025194717\" title=\"Cow Hungry.png (214 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Cow Hungry\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cow Hungry.png (214 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Cow Hungry\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Cow Hungry</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ACow_Summer_Full.png\" title=\"Cow Summer Full.png (136 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/20/Cow_Summer_Full.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/166?cb=20130711080958\" title=\"Cow Summer Full.png (136 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Cow Summer Full\" height=\"185\" width=\"175\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cow Summer Full.png (136 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Cow Summer Full\" height=\"185\" width=\"175\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Cow Summer Full</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ACow_Summer.png\" title=\"Cow Summer.png (139 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/77/Cow_Summer.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20130711080938\" title=\"Cow Summer.png (139 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Cow Summer\" height=\"185\" width=\"184\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cow Summer.png (139 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Cow Summer\" height=\"185\" width=\"184\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Cow Summer</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ACow_Summer_Hungry.png\" title=\"Cow Summer Hungry.png (115 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/ba/Cow_Summer_Hungry.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20130711080948\" title=\"Cow Summer Hungry.png (115 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Cow Summer Hungry\" height=\"124\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cow Summer Hungry.png (115 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Cow Summer Hungry\" height=\"124\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Cow Summer Hungry</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ACow_Halloween.png\" title=\"Cow Halloween.png (117 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/55/Cow_Halloween.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/175?cb=20160827160331\" title=\"Cow Halloween.png (117 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Cow Halloween\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cow Halloween.png (117 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Cow Halloween\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Cow Halloween</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ACows_Winter.png\" title=\"Cows Winter.png (482 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/02/Cows_Winter.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/162?cb=20260516224622\" title=\"Cows Winter.png (482 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Cows Winter\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cows Winter.png (482 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Cows Winter\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Cows Winter</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ACow_Halloween_Full.png\" title=\"Cow Halloween Full.png (123 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/38/Cow_Halloween_Full.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/110?cb=20141028102601\" title=\"Cow Halloween Full.png (123 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Cow Halloween Full\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cow Halloween Full.png (123 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Cow Halloween Full\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Cow Halloween Full</div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Alternate appearance</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/themes-25920\" title=\"Themes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Themes</a></i>\n</p><p>Cows wear themed clothes and accessories during summer, Halloween and winter.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Buying</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/fe/Cow_Pasture.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713111500\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Cow pasture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cow pasture\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Cow pasture</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Cows must be placed in <a href=\"/wiki/cow-pasture-2717\" title=\"Cow Pasture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">cow pastures</a> to be purchased. Pastures cost 20 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> each. They are unlocked at levels 6, 15 and 27. Each pasture can house five cows.\n</p><p>At level 6 cows cost 50 coins each; at level 15, 600 coins; at level 32, 1,150 coins.\n</p><p>Cows and cow pastures can be bought from the <a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shop</a>.<span>Shop</span><span title=\"Shop\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"43\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Harvesting</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/3c/Milk_Bucket.png/revision/latest?cb=20260513194316\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Milk bucket\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Milk bucket\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"170\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Milk bucket</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Milk can be collected from cows every hour. Players can skip the wait by paying 4 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a> per cow. Players must then give cows <a href=\"/wiki/cow-feed-2091\" title=\"Cow Feed\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">cow feed</a> to get another harvest.\n</p><p>Cow feed is made of:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/corn-2063\" title=\"Corn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Corn\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/soybean-2079\" title=\"Soybean\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Soybean\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x2</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>It takes 10 minutes to make 3 units of <a href=\"/wiki/cow-feed-2091\" title=\"Cow Feed\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">cow feed</a>. You can easily collect all your milk and replenish your feed stock by the time the cows are ready to be milked again.</li>\n<li>While milk can be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/daily-dirt-2679\" title=\"Daily Dirt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Daily Dirt</a> it is a sought-after item as it is also needed to feed <a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-cats-7569\" title=\"Category:Cats\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">cats</a>.</li>\n<li>Feeding farm animals and harvesting milk are common tasks in <a href=\"/wiki/derby-18422\" title=\"Derby\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">derbies</a>.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Easter egg</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Tapping on a cow pasture makes the cows squint their eyes and moo.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Fun facts</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Cows can sleep standing up in real life.</li>\n<li>Cows can see almost 360 degrees around them!</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/chicken-2409\" title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a3/Chicken.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025192121\" title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/cow-2488\" title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/84/Cow.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025194659\" title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/duck-16989\" title=\"Duck (806 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/38/Duck.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150713101647\" title=\"Duck (806 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Duck (806 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish (224 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f8/Sockeye_Salmon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150711153706\" title=\"Fish (224 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Fish (224 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/goat-2346\" title=\"Goat (319 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/im